null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m037-0177","start":177,"end":179,"surface":"丞相","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"集體、官稱、未名者或待核回指；不補姓名，王作動詞不當人名。"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m037-0189","start":189,"end":195,"surface":"棘蒲侯柴將軍","kind":"person","person_id":"2rm_drg_ym7","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m037-0198","start":198,"end":201,"surface":"濟北王","kind":"person","person_id":"byp_ks5_71a_AC","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p038","text":"後十二年，文帝十六年，復以齊悼惠王子安都侯志為濟北王。十一年，吳楚反時，志堅守，不與諸侯合謀。吳楚已平，徙志王菑川。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m038-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"文帝","kind":"person","person_id":"28d_4fi_xdp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m038-0013","start":13,"end":17,"surface":"齊悼惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"byp_ks5_71a_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m038-0018","start":18,"end":22,"surface":"安都侯志","kind":"person","person_id":"byp_ks5_71a_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m038-0036","start":36,"end":37,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"byp_ks5_71a_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m038-0053","start":53,"end":54,"surface":"志","kind":"person","person_id":"byp_ks5_71a_AD","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui","book_id":"b-shiji-052","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-052-qidaohui"},{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:p039","text":"濟南王辟光，齊悼惠王子，以勒侯孝文十六年為濟南王。十一年，與吳楚反。漢擊破，殺辟光，以濟南為郡，地入于漢。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-052-qidaohui:m039-0000","start":0,"end":5,"sur